contact our support team.","support-order-cancellation-intro":"Orders placed on our website cannot be cancelled once they've been submitted. However, you can return orders for a complete refund within 30 days in line with our complete Return Policy. If you need to return an item or order, please wait for the complete order to arrive and then contact our support team for a Return Authorization Number (RA#) and pre-paid shipping label. All returns will be inspected to verify product and condition, and applicable refunds will be automatically processed within 14 days to the original form of payment only. You can review the \u003ca href=\"{{returnPolicyUrl}}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\u003efull Return Policy\u003c/a\u003e but we've provided some tips and answers to common questions below.","support-order-cancellation-title":"Order Cancellation \u0026 Returns","support-phone-hours":"Monday to Friday 8am – 4:30pm PT","support-phone-number":"866-273-8455","support-quick-chat":"Chat with a Support Agent","support-quick-create-case":"Create a New Support Case","support-quick-view-cases":"View My Existing Support Cases","support.complaintCodes.error":"Failed to load support options. Please try again.","support_carousel":{"bgColor":"--sg-primary-ramp-7","productManuals":[{"altText":"Product Hub","btnLink":"https://www.breville.com/en-us/producthub","image":"https://assets-dam.foodthinkers.com/ZKCA55LU/at/7qb6r6qwnjfx7t874kq72j/question.svg","openInNewTab":"true","title":"Product Hub","type":"supporthub"},{"altText":"Instruction Manual","btnLink":"https://assets.breville.com/BES880/BES880_USCM_IB_U22_FA_LR.pdf'","image":"https://assets-dam.foodthinkers.com/ZKCA55LU/at/x6b32kf9v86999cpqfpfh86/manual.svg","openInNewTab":"true","title":"Instruction Manual","type":"pdf"},{"altText":"Product Registration","btnLink":"https://www.breville.com/en-us/product-registration","image":"https://assets-dam.foodthinkers.com/ZKCA55LU/at/r5549g5cstj5n6jj5ghmwfj/product-regist