rt a new savings cycle. Each new appliance unlocks up to 25% off coffee for up to 4 years—or until its individual savings limit is reached.","allExpiredTitle":"Your coffee savings have ended","enrolledNoSavingsDescription":"Your 25% discount is live. Every beanz.com order now adds to your savings.\u003cbr\u003eBreville created beanz.com to bring coffee lovers fresh, specialty beans from America's best roasters - so you can enjoy café-quality coffee at home with the machine you already own.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eEnjoy 25% off roaster-direct prices, plus free shipping on subscriptions and orders over $49. Subscriptions are fully flexible - pause, change, or cancel anytime. Or try Barista’s Choice for a rotating selection of new beans in every delivery.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eJust sign in with your registered details on beanz.com, add coffee to cart, and your discount will automatically apply at checkout.","enrolledNoSavingsTitle":"Start saving on delicious coffee","noEnrollmentAlert":"You have no enrolled appliances yet. Enroll one now to start saving 25% on fresh beans.","noEnrollmentDescription":"Make coffee at home just like the top cafes do. Buy a Breville coffee machine and get 2 free bags then 25% off fresh beans from America's best roasters - Save up to $700. Just register your machine within 30 days of purchase. \u003ca href=\"/us/en/legal/fast-track-terms-and-conditions.html\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eT\u0026Cs apply.\u003c/a\u003e","noEnrollmentTitle":"Get 25% off fresh beans - Save up to $700","perksTitle":"Your coffee perks include:","primaryCTA":"Enroll an appliance","primaryCTAHref":"/{{locale}}/product-registration","savingsInProgressDescription":"Your 25% coffee discount is active. Every beanz.com order adds to your total savings.","savingsInProgressTitle":"Your coffee savings are brewing","secondaryCTA":"Learn more","secondaryCTAHref":"/{{locale}}/program/fast-track","perks":["25% off roaster-direct pricing","Discount on coffee subscriptions or one-off purchases","Free shipping on subscriptions","Delivered to your schedule","Change, pause or cancel subscriptions at any time"],"perksEnrolledNoSavings":["First 2 bags free then 25% off roaster prices","Free shipping","No subscription required","Delivered to your schedule","Cancel any time"]},"saveUpto":"Save up to {{amount}}","saved":"saved","savingsHistory":"Savings History","shopLabel":"Learn More","shopLink":"/{{locale}}/program/fast-track","show-less":"Show less","showingCount":"Showing {{showing}} of {{total}} result","tracker":{"cta":{"enrollAppliance":"Enroll Appliance to Save Again","shopCoffee":"Shop Coffee","shopMachines":"Shop Machines to Save Again"},"enrollLink":"/{{locale}}/product-registration","message":{"completed":"Congratulations, You've maxed out your coffee savings! 🏆","expired":"Your savings period ended. You saved {{amount}} 🏆","inProgress":"You've saved {{amount}} so far 🥳","noSavings":"Start shopping to earn your first savings ☕"},"pendingApproval":"Your enrollment is pending approval.","shopCoffeeLink":"/{{locale}}/coffee","shopMachinesLink":"/{{locale}}/shop/espresso","title":"Coffee Savings","validityMessage":"Savings valid through {{date}}"},"viewOrder":"View Order","backToCoffeeSavings":"Back to Coffee Savings"},"dashboard":{"greeting":"Hi","myAppliance":{"label":"My Appliances","viewAll":"View all appliances"},"myClasses":{"label":"My Classes","viewAll":"View all classes"},"myOrders":{"label":"My Orders","viewAll":"View all orders"},"mySubscriptions":{"label":"My Subscriptions","nextOrder":"Next order","viewAll":"Manage subscriptions"}},"order":{"buttonAriaLabel":"My Order","details":{"bag":"bag","bagsContainers":"{{quantity}} bags","box":"box","every":"every","perBag":"per bag","quantity":"Quantity","subscriptionFrequency":"every {{frequency}}","BaristaChoice":"Barista’s Choice"},"emptyText":"You currently do not have any orders","filter":{"all-filters":"Filters","clear-filters":"clear all"},"highToLow":"High to Low","label":"Order","latest":"Latest","lowToHigh":"Low to High","oldest":"Oldest","shopLabel":"Start shopping","shopLink":"/{{locale}}","sortBy":"Sort by","status-cancelled":"Cancelled","status-invoiced":"Invoiced","status-partiallyShipped":"Partially Shipped","status-paymentRequired":"Payment Required","status-processing":"Processing","status-shipped":"Shipped","title":"Orders","year":"Year","shipping":"Shipping","standardShipping":"Standard Shipping","payment":"Payment","free":"Free","clearAll":"Clear all","discount":"Discount"},"price":"{{formattedAmount}}","pricePerBag":"{{formattedAmount}} per bag","pricePerUnit":"{{formattedAmount}} per {{unit}}","subscription":{"alertMessage":"Updates to existing subscriptions must be made 24 hours prior to the next order date.","bagSize":"Bag Size","bags":"bags","beanzDeliveryContainer":"{{quantity}} bag","beanzDeliveryContainers":"{{quantity}} bags","billingAddress":"Billing Address","brevilleDeliveryContainer":"{{quantity}} box","brevilleDeliveryContainers":"{{quantity}} boxes","buttonAriaLabel":"My Subscription","cancelSubscription":{"btnLabel":"Cancel subscription","cancelBtnLabel":"Cancel my subscription","cancellationSuccess":"Subscription cancelled","cancellationSuccessDescription":"Thanks for being part of our coffee journey. We’ll miss you!","close":"Close","error":"Oops !","errorDescription":"Something went wrong","offerBtnLabel":"Redeem Offer","offerCancelBtnLabel":"Continue Cancelling","offerDescription":"Get 20% off your subscription for 3 months","offerTitle":"Care to negotiate?","perBag":"per bag","surveyComments":"Additional comments","surveyCommentsPlaceholder":"Please add any further comments...","surveyCommentsRequired":"Please enter comments","surveyDescription":"Please select the reason you are cancelling","surveyError":"Please select the reason","surveyTitle":"Help us understand why you’re leaving","thankYou":"Thanks for sticking around","thankYouDescription":"Your subscription has been updated"},"cancelled":"Cancelled","changeCoffee":{"baristasPicks":"Barista","browseCoffees":"Browse Coffees","btnLabel":"Change Coffee","cancel":"Cancel – Keep my current coffee","chooseYourOwn":"Choose your own","description":"You will be redirected to beanz.com to change your coffee subscription","discountAlert":"Your {{message}} Discount will apply to your newly selected coffee","exploreByRoast":"Explore by roast","getBaristasChoice":"Get Barista","letUsChoose":"Let us choose for you","title":"Let"},"changeCoffeeFreeBagInfo":"Change coffee will become available once all free bags are used","edit":"Edit","editAddress":{"address1":"Address 1","address2":"Address 2 (optional)","billingAddressTitle":"Edit Billing","cancelBtnLabel":"Cancel","city":"City / Town","company":"Company (optional)","companyMaxLength":"Company name must be less than 30 characters","country":"Country","editBtnLabel":"Edit","error":"Error updating address","fieldError":"Please correct the errors below","firstName":"First Name","lastName":"Last Name","nonShippableAddress":"Submitted","nonShippableBtnLabel":"Change address","nonShippableMessage":"We are not able to ship to the address you have submitted. Please change the address to a verified address to avoid delivery delays.","nonShippableTitle":"Non-Shippable Address","saveBtnLabel":"Save","setAsDefault":"Set as default","shippingAddressTitle":"Edit Shipping","state":"State","submittedAddress":"Submitted","success":"Address updated successfully","suggestedAddress":"Suggested","verificationError":"Error verifying address","verificationMessage":"Avoid delivery delays by using a verified address. Please check your submitted address or use the suggested","verificationTitle":"Verify Address","verifyBtnLabel":"Verify","zipCode":"Zip code"},"editPayment":{"addNewCard":"Add a new card","cancelBtnLabel":"Cancel","expiryDate":"Expiration Date","saveBtnLabel":"Save","securityCode":"Security Code","tempChargesMessage":"A temporary $1 charge will be made to verify your credit card. Once the card is verified, this $1 transaction is then cancelled.","title":"Edit Payment"},"editTitle":"Edit subscription details","emptyText":"You do not have any subscriptions","every-frequency-week":"Every {{frequency}} week","every-frequency-weeks":"Every {{frequency}} weeks","expired":"Expired","expires":"Expires","frequency":"Frequency","grind":"Grind","history":{"backButtonLabel":"{{ label }} Subscription","btnLabel":"History","title":"Order History"},"manage":"Manage Subscription","manage-subscriptions":"Manage subscriptions","my-subscriptions":"My Subscriptions","nextOrder":"Next Order Processing Date","orderHelp":{"frequency":"Frequency","frequencyDescription":"Purchase just one time or subscribe to get your coffee ordered automatically","grind":"Grind","grindDescription":"Select if you want your beans whole or ground to suit your brew method. Note that not all roasters will support this option.","price":"Price","priceDescription":"This is the price per bag","quantity":"Quantity","quantityDescription":"Select the number of bags you would like to order.","title":"Order Help"},"paymentMethod":{"close":"Close","editBtnLabel":"Edit","error":"Sorry","errorDescription":"Please check your payment details and submit your order again","title":"Payment Method"},"promotionProgress":"- {{consumedFreeBags}} of {{totalFreeBags}} bags claimed","quantity":"Quantity","shippingAddress":"Shipping Address","shopLabel":"Start shopping","shopLink":"/{{locale}}","somethingWentWrong":"Something went wrong. Please try again. If you encounter this error for a second time","status-active":"ACTIVE","status-cancelled":"CANCELLED","status-paused":"INACTIVE","summary":{"bagSizeInfo":"Most common weight is {{size}}. The size and type of coffee bags may vary depending on availability. Net weight of each bag is marked on the packaging.","cost":"Cost","discount":"Discount","orderTotal":"Order Total","shipping":"Shipping","tax":"Tax"},"title":"Subscription","view-details":"View details","backButtonLabel":"All Subscriptions","editDetails":{"nextOrderDate":"Next Order Date","grindType":"GrindType","bagsCount":"Bags Each Delivery","frequency":"Frequency","pauseSubscription":"Pause Subscription","quantity":"Quantity","saveBtnLabel":"Save","cancelBtnLabel":"Cancel","pauseSubscriptionPlaceholder":"Select a date to pause subscription"},"addNewCard":"Add a new card","orderSummary":"Order summary","Bags":"Bags","perBag":"per bag","every":"every","payment-issue-prefix":"Payment issue detected —","payment-issue-suffix":"to reactivate your subscription.","perDelivery":"per delivery","promotion":"Promotion","resume":"Resume Subscription","resumeSubscription":{"cancel":"Cancel","resume":"Resume","title":"Resume Subscription?"},"update-payment":"update your payment method","whenExchanged":"When exchanged","view-detail-aria-label":"View details for {{ productName }} subscription","returnLabelNoLink":"Not Yet Generated"},"support":{"cancelBtnLabel":"Cancel","description":"You will be redirected to the Support Hub page.","supportHubBtnLabel":"Support Hub","supportHubBtnLink":"https://support.breville.com/s/?language=en_US\u0026region=us\u0026brand=breville","title":"Support Hub"},"rewards":{"bagsShipped":"bags shipped","viewSubscription":"View subscription details"}},"cashbackRewardsFaq":{"title":"FAQ","description":"Everything you need to know about Cashback Rewards.","items":[{"question":"How many times can I register?","answer":"\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eOnly one (1) registration per product is permitted. If you purchase more than one participating Product, you may register each product in the program. However, cashback from your coffee beans purchases will be applied to a single Product until you have earned full cashback on that product. Subsequent coffee purchases will be credited to the next participating product.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"},{"question":"When will I get my cashback?","answer":"\u003cp\u003eOnce a milestone has been reached and the payout has been processed, the payee can expect funds to be deposited to their bank account within 1-3 business days. (Processing times vary by financial institution and is subject to change). You will receive an email when the payout has been processed successfully.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"},{"question":"Will I receive two free bags of coffee beans?","answer":"\u003cp\u003eWhen your registration is fully completed we will ship your 2 compilmentary bags of coffee beans from Beanz.com by Breville in the next 5 to 7 business days.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"},{"question":"Can I cash out at anytime?","answer":"\u003cp\u003eFor every $100 of coffee you purchase (complimentary or discounted bags excluded) during the Purchase Period, Breville shall issue $25 cashback up to and until you reach the Full Cashback. Under no circumstances will any partially earned cashback be awarded.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"},{"question":"Are cashback payouts automatic?","answer":"\u003cp\u003eCashback payouts will be made automatically when you reach each milestone provided that you have set up your payout method.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"},{"question":"What are my options for where I receive my cashback?","answer":"\u003cp\u003eYour cashback will be credited to the bank account you designate. The program does not currently support other payout options.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}]},"hyperwallet":{"labels":{"logoImgSrc":"https://assets-dam.foodthinkers.com/ZKCA55LU/at/pmbzfpj4s77zgzj835b7gnjg/hyperwallet-pp-color.png?format=webp","description":"When you earn $25 in cashback, payouts will be made automatically to your preferred destination","modal":{"setup":{"heading":"Set up cashback payouts","title":"Complete the following information","subtitle":"This will be used to verify your identity to setup your cashback transfer method","ctaLabel":"Continue to transfer method"},"update":{"heading":"Update cashback payouts","title":"Complete the following information","subtitle":"This will be used to verify your identity to setup your cashback transfer method","ctaLabel":"Update personal details"},"payment":{"heading":"Payout settings","title":"Cashback Destination","message":"We only accept Bank or Debit Card details at this time. Credit Cards are not supported for cashback rewards. Thank you for your understanding!"}}}},"coffeePromotion":{"placeHolderCardTile":{"title":"Earn up to $200 cashback when you purchase coffee from beanz.com","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe same beans used by specialty cafés, at roaster direct pricing, delivered fresh to your door.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","btnLabel":"Shop for coffee on beanz.com","btnLink":"https://www.beanz.com/en-us","secondaryBtnLabel":"Manage purchases","secondaryBtnLink":"https://www.beanz.com/us/en/my-beanz/purchases.html#subscription"},"placeHolderImage":{"alt":"img","src":"https://breville.scene7.com/is/image/brevilleprod/FastTrackBaristaPack_BrevilleUS_Static_WhyBeanz_1260x945?fmt=png-alpha"},"placeHolderAspectRatio":{"ratio":"1-1","rounded":true},"isPromo":false},"campaignPromotion":{"placeHolderCardTile":{"title":"Register your Breville espresso or coffee machine to earn cashback on coffee from beanz.com by Breville","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe same beans used by specialty cafés, at roaster direct pricing, delivered fresh to your door\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","btnLabel":"Get started","btnLink":"https://www.breville.com/en-us/program/fast-track-barista-pack"},"placeHolderImage":{"alt":"fastrack coffee","src":"https://breville.scene7.com/is/image/brevilleprod/FastTrackBaristaPack_BrevilleUS_Static_WhyFastTrack_1260x945?fmt=png-alpha"},"placeHolderAspectRatio":{"ratio":"4-3","rounded":true},"isPromo":true},"translation_key":"default_value","coffeeSavings":{"faq":"FAQs"},"error-go-to-homepage":"Go to Homepage","page-not-found":"Uh oh! Looks like this page needs a tune up.","show-more":"Show More","blog":{"shopThePost":"Shop the post"},"pr-invalid-serial-number":"We couldn’t verify that serial number. Upload your purchase receipt instead.","usually-purchased-with":"USUALLY PURCHASED WITH","Found Better Price":"Found Better Price","Changed Mind":"Changed Mind","Wrong Product(s) Ordered":"Wrong Product(s) Ordered","Delivery Not Fast Enough":"Delivery Not Fast Enough","Other":"Other","Other / No Reason Given":"Other / No Reason Given","be-bag-every-months":"{{quantity}} every {{frequency}} months","ga-validation-non-shippable-zipcode-message":"Please enter a valid post code","ga-first-name":"First Name","ga-last-name":"Last Name","ga-create-account-with":"or create an account with","ga-sign-in-with":"or sign in with","ga-sign-in-error":"That email and password combination does not exist. Please try again.","ga-create-account-error-user-exists":"Sorry a user already exists with this email address.","ga-create-account-error-default":"Whoops! Something went wrong. Please try again.","ga-send-email":"Send","ga-back-to-sign-in":"Back to sign in","ga-account-tnc":"\u003cp class=\"form-paragraph\"\u003eSign up and receive 10% discount on your first order! By signing up you agree to our \u003ca href=\"https://www.breville.com/au/en/legal/terms-of-use.html\" target=\"_blank \" class=\"form-underline\"\u003eterms and conditions\u003c/a\u003e and to receive newsletters and marketing updates from Breville Appliances and our affiliated brands and acknowledge that you have read our \u003ca href=\"https://www.breville.com/au/en/legal/privacy-policy.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"form-underline\"\u003eprivacy policy.\u003c/a\u003e You have the right to opt out of our newsletters and marketing updates at any time.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","ga-account-tnc-checkbox":"false","ga-forgot-password-submitted":"Thanks for submitting your email address","ga-forgot-password-submitted-message":"If the email address was found, we’ve sent you an email with the information needed to reset your password. The email might take a couple of minutes to reach your account. Please check your junk mail to ensure you receive it.","optional-label":"optional","bof-delivery-address-btn-diff-address":"Search for a different address","gf-enter-your-email-address":"Enter your email address","pr-claim-rewards":"Claim rewards","choose-your-country-or-region":"Choose your country or region","choose-location-legal-text":"In the United Kingdom \u0026 Europe the Breville brand is not owned or operated by Breville Group Limited. Jarden Corp, is a separately owned and managed company that offers a completely different range of products in the U.K. \u0026 Europe to Breville in other parts of the world.","ph-split-teaser-cleaning-desc":"Protect {{ productName }} with genuine cleaning supplies designed for peak performance. Our descaling solutions, tablets, and filters prevent buildup and ensure every shot stays smooth and balanced. Shop directly from {{brand}} for guaranteed quality.","cleaning-supplies-section-title":"Cleaning \u0026 Supplies for","tutorials-carousel-title":"Tutorials \u0026 Guides for","accessories-carousel-title":"Accessories for","masterclass-section-title":"Events \u0026 Classes for","spare-parts-carousel-title":"Parts for","ph_faq_and_troubleshooting":"FAQs \u0026 Troubleshooting for","recipe-section-title":"Recipes for","shop-product":"Shop {{ productName }}","ph-split-teaser-cleaning-eyebrow":"Genuine {{brand}} Cleaning Supplies","register-your-machine-title":"Get more out of\u003cbr\u003e{{ productName }}.\u003cbr\u003e Benefits, Access and More","get-started-title":"Get started with {{ productName }}","ftbp":"Get 25% off fresh beans","ftbp-description":"Get 25% off fresh beans from America's best roasters on beanz.com - Save up to $700. Start with 2 free bags. Just register your machine within 30 days of purchase.","reg-coffee-bean-title":"Beanz.com","reg-coffee-bean-desc":"Coffee beans from the best roasters in the country","warranty":"Warranty","reg-warranty-desc":"Register to track your purchase history and speed up any warranty claims.","reg-support-title":"Priority Support","reg-support-desc":"Unlock priority support for your appliance with a quick registration.","reg-personalized-title":"Get the best from your machine","reg-personalized-desc":"From setup to mastery, register your appliance for guided tutorials","reg-maintenance-title":"Ongoing maintenance support","reg-maintenance-desc":"From descaling to routine upkeep, we'll let you know when it's time to clean, which products to use and how to do it specific to your machine.","reg-promotions-title":"Product and promotion news","reg-promotions-desc":"Be the first to know about our newest innovations, thoughtfully created and revelead to our community.","register-your-machine":"Register your machine","getting-started":"Getting started","coffee":"Coffee","cleaning-supplies":"Cleaning Supplies","tutorials-guides":"Tutorials \u0026 Guides","accessories":"Accessories","events-classes":"Events \u0026 Classes","recipes":"Recipes","replacement-parts":"Replacement Parts","troubleshooting-faqs":"Troubleshooting \u0026 FAQs","tutorials-carousel-description":"Our tutorials walk you through setup, first use, and expert tips for your machine.","learn-more":"Learn more","beanz-section-carousel-title":"Best Selling Coffee from beanz.com","beanz-section-carousel-description":"Beanz offers a handpicked selection from the world’s finest roasters, delivered fresh to your door.","shop-all":"Shop All","download-breville-plus-coffee-app":"Smarter brewing starts here","app-modal-subtitle":"Download the Breville+ Coffee app and connect your Oracle Dual Boiler to unlock remote power-on, tutorial videos, tips and more.","download-the-app":"Download the app","app-modal-qr-code-text":"On a desktop computer? Scan the QR code with your phone.","app-modal-store-text":"To download the Breville+ Coffee app, visit a store below.","app-modal-app-store-aria-label":"Download the Breville+ coffee app from the App Store","app-modal-play-store-aria-label":"Download the Breville+ coffee app from Google Play Store","ph-split-teaser-cleaning-title":"Keep Your Espresso Machine in Peak Condition","ph-split-teaser-cleaning":"Shop All Cleaning Supplies","cleaning-supplies-section-description":"From descaler to brushes, get timely reminders and the right tools to keep your machine in top shape.","accessories-carousel-description":"Discover thoughtfully engineered accessories that help you perfect every step of the coffee ritual.","masterclass-section-description":"Join our experts for a masterclass and learn how to get the most out of your machine.","recipe-section-description":"Explore our collection of recipes and learn how to get the most out of your machine.","spare-parts-carousel-description":"Our parts make it easy to care for your machine and keep it performing like new.","instruction-manual":"Instruction manual","warranty-repair":"Warranty \u0026 Repair","return-policy":"Return Policy","parts":"Parts","contact-us":"Chat with support","productSupportTitle":"{{productName}} - {{productCategory}} Support \u0026 FAQs | {{brand}} {{region}}","productSupportDescription":"Explore helpful tutorials, guides, and product support for {{productName}} to make the most out of your new appliance. Master every moment with {{brand}}.","coffeeSavingsFaq":{"title":"FAQ","description":"Everything you need to know about Coffee Savings.","items":[{"question":"Why did we create this program?","answer":"We created this program to help you get the best out of your coffee machine from the very first cup. It’s designed to make true specialty quality coffee at home more accessible by offering you 25% off fresh beans from the best roasters in America, with up to $700* in savings available. We'll even give you 2 free bags to get started. And we're the ones covering the cost - so roasters stay whole and you're set up for success from your very first cup. \u003ca href=\"/us/en/legal/fast-track-terms-and-conditions.html\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eTerms apply.\u003c/a\u003e"},{"question":"Who is beanz.com?","answer":"The best tasting cup of coffee requires the right beans. That’s why Breville created beanz.com - to connect coffee lovers with a curated selection of 190+ specialty beans, freshly roasted by the country's best and delivered straight to your door. All coffees are at roaster-direct prices with free shipping on subscriptions and one-off orders over $49. You can even try Barista’s Choice and explore a rotating selection of different delicious beans with every delivery."},{"question":"What are the eligibility requirements?","answer":"To be eligible for the coffee savings program, you must have purchased a participating product on or after March 24, 2025 from Breville.com or an authorized retailer. You must register the machine using the same email linked to your beanz.com account. Participants must reside in the United States (excluding U.S. territories), be at least 18 years old, and be the end user of the product—meaning it was purchased for personal use, not resale or commercial purposes. Each machine can only be registered once, and in the case of gifted machines, either the giver or the recipient may register, but not both."},{"question":"Can I register more than one machine?","answer":"Yes! If you purchase multiple Breville machines during the program period, you can register each one. You’ll receive 25% off coffee beans purchased from beanz.com for every machine, with each having its own individual Discount Savings - depending on the machines you purchase, you may be eligible for up to $700 in discounts for each. See the Discount Savings Cap table for specific discount for each participating product."},{"question":"What is the total discount savings for each machine?","answer":"\u003ctable style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; border-collapse:collapse; width:100%;'\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eParticipating Product\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eDiscount Savings Cap\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES450 The Bambino\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$300\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES500 The Bambino Plus\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$500\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBEP501 Baratza Encore ESP x the Bambino Plus\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$650\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES870 The Barista Express\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES876 The Barista Express Impress\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES878 The Barista Pro\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES880 The Barista Touch\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES881 The Barista Touch Impress\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES920 The Dual Boiler\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBEP920 The Dynamic Duo\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES985 The Oracle Jet\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES980 The Oracle\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES990 The Oracle Touch\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBES995 The Oracle Dual Boiler\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$700\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBDC465 The Luxe Brewer Thermal\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$350\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBDC415 The Luxe Brewer Glass\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$350\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBDC650 The Grind Control\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$350\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBDC400 The Breville Precision Brewer Glass\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$350\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003eBDC450 The Breville Precision Brewer Thermal\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style='border:1px solid #e6e5e5; padding:8px; text-align:center;'\u003e$350\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/table\u003e"},{"question":"How is the discount applied?","answer":"Once your machine is enrolled, the discount is automatically applied at checkout when you purchase coffee on beanz.com—just make sure you’re logged in using the same email address you used to register your machine."},{"question":"How are savings tracked?","answer":"Every order’s savings are automatically logged in your Breville account’s tracker. You can view your transaction history, cap progress, and remaining savings in real time."},{"question":"How long does the discount last?","answer":"Your 25% discount is valid for up to 4 years on Breville purchases from your approval date or until you’ve reached your savings cap—whichever happens first."},{"question":"What if I'm registered in the Fast-Track Barista Pack Cashback program?","answer":"You cannot participate in both simultaneously. If already enrolled in the Cashback program, you won't be able to transfer to this discount program. However, any new purchases of Breville machines would qualify for this program after the cash back time or amount limits are reached. See full \u003ca href=\"https://www.breville.com/us/en/legal/fast-track-terms-and-conditions.html\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eTerms\u003c/a\u003e for details."},{"question":"Can Breville change or cancel the program?","answer":"Yes. Breville may modify or end the program at any time, but any already-approved participants can continue using their discount until their cap or redemption period ends."},{"question":"How is my data handled?","answer":"Your savings data and order history are securely displayed in your Breville account. All information is handled in accordance with our \u003ca href=\"https://www.breville.com/us/en/legal/privacy-policy.html\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e"},{"question":"Can I combine savings from different BRG brands?","answer":"Yes! If you purchase machines from multiple BRG brands during the applicable Purchase Period (Breville, Baratza), your savings caps will combine. Each enrolled machine adds to your total available savings and will be visible in your account across brands."}]},"product-registration":{"enablePlaceOfPurchase":true,"title":"Register your Breville appliance","errorText":"Please add/select all the mandatory fields","continueButtonLabel":"Continue","submitButtonLabel":"Submit","countryofPurchaseDefaultText":"Please select","segment-selector":{"title":"Is your appliance new or refurbished?","subTitle":"This helps us understand warranty coverage.","productSegments":[{"label":"New","value":"false"},{"label":"Refurbished","value":"true"}]},"select-category":{"title":"Choose your appliance type","show-less":"Show Less","show-more":"Show More"},"select-product":{"title":"Choose your machine","variant-title":"Select your appliance color","show-less":"Show Less","show-more":"Show More","variant-selector-title":"Select your color","selected-variant-color":"Selected: {{color}}","next":"Next"},"product-selector":{"title":"Register your appliance","productSegments":[{"label":"New","value":"false"},{"label":"Refurbished","value":"true"}],"productSegmentLabel":"New or Refurbished","productCategoryLabel":"Which product